Native Quickshell recovery dependency

quickshell-qt612.patch contains changes from quickshell-mirror/quickshell commit
5d5d49873fe8cf1f99ddfd5006ceb2057c5c9b13, authored by Cloud0310 and committed
by outfoxxed. The fifteen source-file changes are retained; its changelog entry
is omitted for the backport to release 0.3.1 commit
1a4716cde794a59928d9d9fc15f2afc7a95de360. This material is Quickshell source,
not original Nacre implementation, and remains under its upstream GNU LGPL v3.

